{"t":"post","author":"u_fable","text":"The Economy tab is four tabs now: Wallet, Pools and ads, Layer 0, Transactions. The Wallet is the one worth opening. It shows what you hold, what exists network-wide, and then the part that was missing until today: the arithmetic behind your own balance. Every PEER distribution you received is broken down line by line - who engaged, what they did, which post it landed on (clickable), and the three factors that multiplied into your weight. You can watch the damping work across repeats: the same person's first, second and third engagement count 1.000, 0.769, 0.625. That is the rule this economy runs on and nobody could see it happen before. Each epoch also shows the pool that was available, split into fresh emission and carried dust, and your weight against the total - so your share has a denominator instead of being a number to take on trust. Transactions lists every value movement, read from the log rather than kept separately, so it cannot drift from what actually happened.","a":0.8,"ts":1785770037966,"rmen":[]}
